{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本｜日本食品一向有吸引力，不少生產商會採用一個充滿「日本味道」的名字。《香港01》「好食玩飛」記者整理了6個經常令人誤會是日本的飲食品牌，看看你是否一直搞錯？EDO、八月堂也不是來自日本的品牌喔！</p><p>👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p><figure><img alt=\"日本食品包裝精美味道又好，是不少港人至愛。（François Brémont＠unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210730/497756517395599360487956.jpeg/wnSiuH2Hap5Yt7Co9vM-h0oF3zlf6JoURdfgdkXX4HY\"/><figcaption>日本食品包裝精美味道又好，是不少港人至愛。（François Brémont＠unsplash）</figcaption></figure><p>【1】Kojimaya 小島屋</p><p>早前品牌推出的Lipton紅茶雪糕、微熱山丘D24榴槤雪糕和土鳳梨雪糕都大受歡迎，曾在「香港雪糕關注組」群組內掀起長期的熱烈討論。。由於牌子使用日文拼音，令很多人都以為它是日本品牌。但早前有眼尖網民發現，其實Kojimaya是香港牌子，並由港產雪糕品牌CocoBerry生產，曾經在「香港雪糕關注組」谷內掀起好一陣子的熱烈討論。</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig @ mynameisdorothy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495305496815734784264091.jpeg/A7J8afjpxUAYodObtEo0OCfbuR1-RviOzgANEM4ADRA\"/><figcaption>（ig @ mynameisdorothy）</figcaption></figure><p>6個品牌中，包括人氣長龍牛角包店「八月堂」，無論名字和Logo都帶有濃濃的和風，但原來竟不是日本過江龍！\n立即按圖睇睇6大令人誤會來自日本的品牌😲👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307594575908864143876.jpeg/60Bsj44rzAH3aUKt22g-sLAO-cRB4lenLrKg8y6yoPM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307596668997632921786.jpeg/F-2Lx8pe-R9EmZD2aXqZxWsnqkz97Onbnxbf358W398\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307599005356032237980.jpeg/c_d55GF0kl6wiOyZoCvgSatOVrttAbeCvE-CgbxPgoE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307601568206848430152.jpeg/tIfABZ_TPqxVaah8pVJ5zIcYzfl4nLVcVgwS9lYMEvY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307604055560192691724.jpeg/wmMMx-Owjat6HbwXXqjXgWHV1O9RjdwJaZDeJ2mQ3ic\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307606459158528703421.jpeg/3SstzhBOZqoe-Q1GXT4Xm0-7VzOcR3hM_GvD7Pxrw-w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307608950706176037841.jpeg/1eZD2lPdIAXCpvuvfP8XJtwC5gqay1sbBe77CAXu-wg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307611786186752285901.jpeg/GjiiaXDZ_e73qEMZmnL0FxD2LMQLh0jgbegVg23oFYM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307614005104640873210.jpeg/dj9qHJ4umbIv1AG3Gb3i7cFGir6YVzRJsHSSGLB0khg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307588615802880093621.jpeg/mlZ0z0Tsmt1JIJhCPrSlLOpMwh7ElZuArxIn5a8SJ-U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307591455477760962570.jpeg/KuPbxwWJB6yld9eM0ZAbDYOK1AkWptihvV05pb1dOaU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495307594618114048483062.jpeg/Z1RhtAsjRrareQDugf7fPmvMmG7F4OXTlTak7pU2pO4\"/><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:41:55.953609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":487,"images":14,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:35:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T10:37:47.922185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:37:41.026200+00:00","content_hash":"f0c7dd42196a22bd1d1b2af25e063dc62dc20ece706711728b09ca9b58583d51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}